The DICOM standard
------------------

The DICOM Standard is © NEMA. DICOMFall links to its sections and quotes only short
names and field labels. The tag dictionary shown in the game comes from go-dicom, which
follows PS3.6.

Synthetic data
--------------

Every DICOM file in the game is synthetic, generated by packages/fixtures, and released
under CC0 1.0 (packages/fixtures/out/LICENSE). No real patient data is used anywhere.
